cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this prototype in research, teaching or a review, cite it as below."
title: "PROHOR: mission health intelligence for astronaut self-assessment"
abstract: >-
  A local-first, non-diagnostic research prototype that records crew health indicators, compares
  each reading against a personal baseline computed from distinct prior days, exposes the rule and
  the data coverage behind every flag, and exports a structured handover packet for human review.
  Includes an in-browser, hash-verified comparison of 531 published NASA OSDR OSD-575 observations.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 3.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tufayelahmedsuhagcc-dotcom/prohor"
url: "https://prohor-rho.vercel.app"
keywords:
